pool, it creates a buffer of mana that will be used before your mana pool.", "notes_en": ["If this mana is not used before the duration ends, the extra mana is lost."], "attributes": ["+ 6 Strength", "+ 2 Armor"], "is_item": true}, {"subject": "specialists_array", "name_zh": "行家阵列", "name_en": "Specialist's Array", "description_en": "Passive: Splitshot Ranged attacks have a %proc_chance%%% chance to fire additional projectiles at up to %count% nearby enemies with %secondary_target_range_bonus% extra range and within a %secondary_target_angle% degree angle in front of the attacker. The additional projectiles deal %base_proc_dmg% + %proc_dmg_pct%%% damage of a normal attack and do not trigger on hit effects. The primary attack deals %base_proc_dmg% + %proc_dmg_pct_primary_tooltip%%% damage of a normal attack.", "notes_en": [], "attributes": ["+ 15 Agility", "+ 20 Damage"], "is_item": true}, {"subject": "sphere", "name_zh": "林肯法球", "name_en": "Linken's Sphere", "description_en": "Passive: Spellblock Blocks most targeted spells once every %block_cooldown% seconds.   Active: Transfer Spellblock Temporarily removes Spellblock from the item's owner and transfers it to an allied unit for %block_cooldown% seconds.", "notes_en": ["Targeted abilities from neutral items do not trigger Spellblock."], "attributes": ["+ 16 All Attributes", "+ 6.5 Health Regeneration", "+ 4.25 Mana Regeneration"], "is_item": true}]
